    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10449" root="خرق" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخْرُوقٌ</span></b>  (tropical:)  One who is <i>denied good,</i> or <i>prosperity; into whose hand wealth falls not.</i> (K,
TA.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخْرُوقُ الكَفِّ</span> (assumed tropical:)  A man <i>who gains not,</i>
or <i>gets not, anything.</i> (JK.) See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خِرْقٌ</span>.

